{
  "about": [
    "The hub's frozen sync wire fixture, version 1 (D-H0BZN in rdy-design, p-1FPMG in rdyhub-design).",
    "Each step holds one request to the real hub and the hub's reply, as the test swf1_ in rdyhub-server/tests/pg_sync_wire_fixture.rs checks them.",
    "Normalized: the bearer token is <token>, and each request id is <request-id>. Object members are in key order.",
    "The hub repo is acme/docs with the site docs-site, owned by ana, on a test install with its default sync settings.",
    "A put body is binary: the file gives its length and sha256. It is the first batch of tag v1.0.0 of rdyhub-core's TwoTags upload fixture, at 10,000 records per batch.",
    "The list not_served names the steps of D-H0BZN that this hub does not serve yet, with the design that sets each one."
  ],
